Vibhishana drops from sky and falls at Rama feet --- Vibhishana renounces Lanka and offers help storming city --- Rama embraces Vibhishana and orders Lakshmana fetch water --- Lakshmana consecrates Vibhishana Lanka king amid monkeys --- Monkeys shout approval seeing Rama grace --- Hanuman Sugriva ask means to cross ocean --- Vibhishana advises Rama seek Sagara-dug ocean refuge --- Lakshmana Sugriva agree bridge alone reaches Lanka --- Rama lies on kusha grass awaiting ocean answer
